                  <nc xml:id="m-85f30592-831e-418f-abce-00edb3098548" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-08cafbc7-0858-4b21-a3c6-546215769453" facs="#m-ee7abd32-ee15-4b32-9e06-a6e70e101117" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-38125e47-770a-492e-af27-b6dc7d2d5af6"><lg xml:id="m-0aa97141-f9e0-497f-aeae-1a914910c48b"><l xml:id="m-a25c71a3-f483-46a5-bce2-769eac2c85ec" facs="#m-dbfb00bc-f5c9-419b-867b-27c37cec2fe7" label="ambiguous">30*</l><l xml:id="m-3cfcb951-d4ee-4e4b-9850-21def03e3d62" facs="#m-89d5311b-ea08-4ba0-9955-026caa4bc9e4" label="ambiguous">Appendix</l><l xml:id="m-7029dfbe-7848-4190-949d-02438bd1747f" facs="#m-38e455f2-f082-4695-8e13-1b5b85d59fd5" label="lyrics-like">37. Vidéte, húmiles, et laetámini, * et reviviscat cor véstrum, qui</l><l xml:id="m-013bf313-c307-41e0-ac38-ac2c4ae3def2" facs="#m-2fb5a622-6524-47c8-a347-8b5b26f80eea" label="lyrics-like">quaéritis Déum,</l><l xml:id="m-f15f6366-6583-42ee-95db-b5930d4fc8ec" facs="#m-eb7eca62-2fa7-49aa-91dd-60b944f60c5c" label="lyrics-like">38. Quia páuperes áudit Dóminus, * et vinctos súos non contémnit.</l><l xml:id="m-3d10e496-4a03-4e29-8bc8-23ead07f01b1" facs="#m-2eef2a79-74e9-44f8-af8b-0d56da7d1abd" label="lyrics-like">39. Láudent illum caéli et térra, * mária et quidquid movétur in éis.</l><l xml:id="m-82227fbf-cf2e-4535-8f2a-9a9c0fc46afc" facs="#m-7f06df7f-ad8f-4bee-a2b7-7a8329091d28" label="lyrics-like">40. Nam Déus salvábit Sion, ! et aedificábit civitátes Júda: *et</l><l xml:id="m-bb151e31-85d5-4ad7-8db6-22c9a97e7d12" facs="#m-3bf33f36-0fb2-48bb-ba66-4549cbf5d535" label="lyrics-like">habitábunt ibi et possidébunt éam.</l><l xml:id="m-eb7c966e-59b9-436f-ae34-d385b385ca62" facs="#m-888744e2-ffad-4cd9-bdaf-a0e068277439" label="lyrics-like">41. Et sémen servórum éjus hereditábit éam; * et qui diligunt nómen</l><l xml:id="m-79b16895-1d23-402f-a0fa-1df112384a0c" facs="#m-70c8cd44-9e3a-4941-82e2-8ef432510551" label="lyrics-like">éjus, morabúntur in éa.</l><l xml:id="m-df4d83aa-307c-4c76-be5d-323edf6e6999" facs="#m-f5fc4bb2-3a65-42b6-b82f-8f010355b336" label="ambiguous">Psalm 69</l><l xml:id="m-a511ecb7-0b90-420c-9342-2a8d0cda1ee0" facs="#m-e896723e-83a6-442d-b080-4b1dbdd3075c" label="lyrics-like">1. Plá-ce-at tibi, Dé-us, ut eri-pi-as me; * Dómine, ad adiuvándum me</l><l xml:id="m-646cdab7-0ca8-477f-930f-115d12b4ec19" facs="#m-47beab08-baea-437e-a3bd-e68d380a955e" label="ambiguous">festi-na.</l><l xml:id="m-6069c2e2-fd41-49dd-82af-44cf383d580f" facs="#m-f67f8e6d-f801-426f-8c9b-e6dccbb54c48" label="lyrics-like">2. Confundántur, et erubéscant, * qui quaérunt vitam méam.</l><l xml:id="m-3b855f5c-e24b-46a5-8d6e-398a47cbed2f" facs="#m-14dae0d8-2fa7-4b4a-bc7f-62aeea4ea8a5" label="lyrics-like">3. Cédant retrórsum, et pudóre afficiántur, *qui delectántur mális</l><l xml:id="m-496fc9d9-5f6c-4ac9-aa16-0633a4d0ee32" facs="#m-12db6d2d-e672-44df-9a8d-a7413c1b48b0" label="lyrics-like">méis.</l><l xml:id="m-d18b0247-8d71-4b1b-b59c-1146760e527c" facs="#m-7d271e8e-43db-4e0c-8d85-b3c23aa48f66" label="lyrics-like">4. Recédant confusióne opérti, * qui dicunt mihi: Euge, éuge!</l><l xml:id="m-e452fef4-91a9-451f-9a55-3486ae7056e8" facs="#m-ff992ff9-1748-42a0-8a7a-02e7f86cfffc" label="lyrics-like">5. Exsúltent et laeténtur de te * ômnes qui quaérunt te;</l><l xml:id="m-63d95237-24e3-4af8-93cb-840445a5b22b" facs="#m-fe1e404b-73ea-40ca-8149-1faaeb62139c" label="lyrics-like">6. Et dicant semper: “Magnificétur Déus», *qui desiderant auxilium</l><l xml:id="m-322eea05-6a52-4c7f-8f90-17f7e5a6ff76" facs="#m-fcc598af-b44b-40de-997f-a420112a4f4b" label="lyrics-like">túum.</l><l xml:id="m-d784d395-d93c-4554-a55b-3300d663a1bc" facs="#m-5411b9b2-985a-4206-904d-d98704d3d653" label="lyrics-like">7. Ego autem miser sum et páuper, * Déus, succúrre mihi!</l><l xml:id="m-30ef9a38-101d-4bd4-9628-bf656be3918a" facs="#m-968bb1d5-bbfb-4138-8211-5b2386d849e2" label="lyrics-like">8. Adiútor méus et liberátor méus es tu: * Dómine, ne tardáveris.</l><l xml:id="m-8cddc357-45d5-4c98-8337-2a8ad856d0c9" facs="#m-c813bef3-3d57-407c-b104-97256ca90f9f" label="ambiguous">Psalm 70</l><l xml:id="m-e1ceb5ca-42a0-43ce-9cd9-ee64f86b6c0a" facs="#m-61b786d6-3a5c-475f-90e4-798d44533a7b" label="lyrics-like">1. Ad te, Dómine, confúgi-o:*ne confúndar in aetér-num;</l><l xml:id="m-2ff8f09b-359d-4957-a6c5-e5afc6f75b60" facs="#m-e0a6ceea-0bcc-4c12-b3a0-ed2d345aa074" label="lyrics-like">Flex: ab úte-ro; t</l><l xml:id="m-d3e3b861-7b8a-4ea7-be23-58439f1eb2cc" facs="#m-afc1278e-5471-47d0-bff5-570c80b3c889" label="lyrics-like">2. Secúndum justitiam túam éripe me et libera me; * inclina ad me</l><l xml:id="m-ea2b16e6-ce1b-45a6-a6d9-c3bf4bb00482" facs="#m-f496667b-f4e0-4577-bc3a-af15e3adf027" label="lyrics-like">áurem túam et sálva me.</l><l xml:id="m-b2a4b003-2620-4fdf-9236-fbd90fdda7a8" facs="#m-2139e8c1-e0f2-4da2-aae9-a841a828f8c7" label="lyrics-like">3. Esto mihi pétra refúgii, arx muníta, ut sálves me: * nam pétra</l><l xml:id="m-b29daf38-7c8d-42ae-b7e4-d1cd8ddc881c" facs="#m-be24adf8-7852-48e8-8be5-c6d222d6a4f0" label="lyrics-like">méa et arx méa es tu.</l><l xml:id="m-41c67657-8e9b-4912-8076-c92cf3c14981" facs="#m-d2643434-8623-4adc-88f1-fa4200305242" label="lyrics-like">4. Déus méus, éripe me de mánu iniqui, * de púgno improbi et</l><l xml:id="m-7ed47c6e-8aaf-406d-b54d-60540a125089" facs="#m-94f98eff-e3a8-42ab-8611-a7220ecfe580" label="lyrics-like">oppressóris:</l><l xml:id="m-109a90ba-0fb0-4671-951f-6f9787d3d405" facs="#m-9eb64394-2bb0-4479-bb5c-5166281a4e43" label="lyrics-like">5. Nam tu es exspectátio méa, Déus méus, *Dómine, spes méa</l><l xml:id="m-c77cd952-ac44-4bf9-954a-35c89e92cf44" facs="#m-688827be-d33c-4bf6-a11d-bc29f6e752f5" label="lyrics-like">a juventúte méa.</l><l xml:id="m-f8e8755d-8747-45b2-aec1-c396662a50d4" facs="#m-70f917ec-0908-4689-93a0-2c790650c298" label="lyrics-like">6. Tibi innixus sum ab útero; † a véntre mátris méae éras protéctor</l><l xml:id="m-b0c8d9f2-75ef-4c9e-8ac3-f336be4f6660" facs="#m-0f01ada2-5fd3-496c-959c-a1d36d44644d" label="lyrics-like">méus: * in te speravi sémper.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>